om/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events{/number}","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/events","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/assignees{/user}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/branches{/branch}","tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/tags","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/blobs{/sha}","git_tags_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/tags{/sha}","git_refs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/refs{/sha}","trees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/trees{/sha}","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/statuses/{sha}","languages_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"`FOR KEY SHARE` is used by postgres while inserting data into a table that has a foreign key reference to another table.\r\nSo, if we have two tables:\r\n```sql\r\nCREATE TABLE base(a int PRIMARY KEY);\r\nCREATE TABLE reference(a int PRIMARY KEY, b int REFERENCES base(a));\r\n```\r\nNow, while inserting a row into ref, postgres will generate a query like\r\n```\r\nSELECT 1 FROM ONLY \"public\".\"base\" x WHERE \"a\" OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=) $1 FOR KEY SHARE OF x\r\n```\r\nIf we have two inserts that are reading the same base value, then we get either \"Transaction Expired\" or \"Transaction conflicts\" error.\r\n\r\nHere is an easy way to reproduce:\r\nIn Session 1:\r\n```sql\r\nINSERT INTO base VALUES(1);\r\nBEGIN;\r\nSELECT 1 FROM ONLY \"public\".\"base\" x WHERE \"a\" OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=) 1 FOR KEY SHARE OF x;\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn session 2:\r\n```sql\r\nBEGIN;\r\nSELECT 1 FROM ONLY \"public\".\"base\" x WHERE \"a\" OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=) 1 FOR KEY SHARE OF x;\r\nCOMMIT; -- This will sometimes fail with conflicts with higher priority transaction.\r\n```\r\n\r\nBack to session 1:\r\n```sql\r\nCOMMIT; -- If COMMIT in session 2 has succeeded, then this fails with \"Operation expired: Transaction expired: 25P02\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nTwo KEY SHARE locks should not conflict. For more information on postgres definition of these locks: https://www.postgresql.org/docs/12/explicit-locking.html\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/2939/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/2939/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2809783656,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDI4MDk3ODM2NTY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/2809783656","actor":{"login":"kmuthukk","id":13615376,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjE1Mzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13615376?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk","html_url":"https://github.com/kmuthukk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-11-19T02:26:30Z","label":{"name":"priority/high","color":"ffdc5e"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/555303613","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/2842#issuecomment-555303613","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/2842","id":555303613,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU1NTMwMzYxMw==","user":{"login":"kmuthukk","id":13615376,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjE1Mzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13615376?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk","html_url":"https://github.com/kmuthukk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kmuthukk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-11-19T02:30:21Z","updated_at":"2019-11-19T02:31:52Z","body":"This is another test case for the related issue (based on an issue reported by Konstantin in slack).\r\n\r\nhttps://gist.github.com/kmuthukk/0778609b63b2468a4446c2fafe9bfe07\r\n\r\nUse of references (FK) in snapshot isolation (REPEATABLE READ) causes above test to run into two kinds of errors:\r\n\r\n```\r\nError during commit: Operation expired: Transaction expired: 25P02\r\n```\r\nand\r\n\r\n```\r\nUnexpected exception: Operation failed. Try again.: c1f51af9-5811-4086-816f-966d2a7b4a6c Conflicts with committed transaction: eedae21d-719a-403e-a08c-8443cfd43238\r\nCONTEXT:  SQL statement \"SELECT 1 FROM ONLY \"public\".\"table1\" x WHERE \"id\" OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=) $1 FOR KEY SHARE OF x\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nCurrent workaround is to change:\r\n\r\n`conn.set_session(autocommit=True, isolation_level=\"REPEATABLE READ\")`\r\nto:\r\n`conn.set_session(autocommit=True, isolation_level=\"SERIALIZABLE\")`\r\nBut once this fix lands, this should be not be required.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/555303613/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kmuthukk","id":13615376,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjE1Mzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13615376?v=4","gravatar_id":""